{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56110","headline":"步虚词 三 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俯仰存太上，华景秀丹田。\n左顾提郁仪，右盼携结璘。\n六度观梵行，道德了袒新。\n宿命积福应，闻经若至亲。\n天扔超世才，乐诵希微篇。\n冲虚太和气，吐纳流霞津。\n胎息静百关，寥寥究三便。\n泥丸洞明镜，遂成金华仙。\n魔王敬受事，故能朝诸天。\n皆从斋戒起，累功结宿缘。\n飞行淩太虚，提携高上人。\n（《正统道藏》本杜光庭《太上黄籙斋仪》卷一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}